@startuml
title Implemented REST system statistics

actor Client
participant StatsController
participant SearchService
participant "volatile State" as State
participant BuildSnapshot
participant InvertedIndex

Client -> StatsController: GET /api/stats
StatsController -> SearchService: stats()
SearchService -> State: capture current completed state
State --> SearchService: BuildSnapshot + uniqueTerms
SearchService -> BuildSnapshot: index(), elapsedMillis(), threads()
SearchService -> InvertedIndex: getDocumentCount()
InvertedIndex --> SearchService: document count
SearchService --> StatsController: StatsResponse
StatsController --> Client: 200 JSON (status, documents, unique_terms, index_build_time_ms, threads_used)

note right of State
The state is published only after
a complete index build. Searches
may continue using the previous state
during a rebuild.
end note
@enduml
